From afcf2825ba956bb8925a975e1192f62709d24e00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 03:50:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Ignore python bytecode from tools/

tools/ has .py helpers in it now, so running any of them leaves a __pycache__ behind. Nothing
reads it and it changes on every run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dc7giZ7Qnh4qy1CYPTDrmH
---
 .gitignore | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index a54f4446..49d21978 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -15,3 +15,7 @@ pack/vars.pack
 pack/map.pack
 pack/midi.pack
 pack/animset.pack
+
+# python bytecode from tools/
+__pycache__/
+*.pyc
-- 
2.43.0

